msgstr "Editar..."

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QPushButton, btAdd)
#: emoticonslist.ui:33
#, kde-format
msgid "Create a new emoticon"
msgstr "Crear un fustaxe nuevu"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QPushButton, btAdd)
#: emoticonslist.ui:36
#, kde-format
msgid "Create a new emoticon by assigning it an icon and some text"
msgstr "Crea un fustaxe nuevu dándo-y un iconu y dél testu"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QPushButton, btAdd)
#: emoticonslist.ui:39
#, kde-format
msgid "Add..."
msgstr "Amestar..."

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QPushButton, btGetNew)
#: emoticonslist.ui:66
#, kde-format
msgid "Get new icon themes from the Internet"
msgstr "Consigui temes d'iconos nuevos d'Internet"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QPushButton, btGetNew)
#: emoticonslist.ui:69
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"You need to be connected to the Internet to use this action. A dialog will "
"display a list of emoticon themes from the http://www.kde-look.org website. "
"Clicking the Install button associated with a theme will install this theme "
"locally."
msgstr ""
"Necesites tar coneutáu a internet pa usar esta aición. Amosaráse un diálogu "
"un llistáu de temes de fustaxes dende'l sitiu web http://www.kde-look.org "
"Primir nel botón d'instalar asociáu, instalará esti tema llocalmente."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QPushButton, btGetNew)
#: emoticonslist.ui:72
#, fuzzy, kde-format
#| msgid "Get New Icon Themes..."
msgid "Get new Theme"
msgstr "Consiguir temes d'iconos nuevos..."

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QPushButton, btInstall)
#: emoticonslist.ui:79
#, kde-format
msgid "Install a theme archive file you already have locally"
msgstr "Instala un archivu de tema que yá tengas llocalmente"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QPushButton, btInstall)
#: emoticonslist.ui:82
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"If you already have an emoticon theme archive locally, this button will "
"unpack it and make it available for KDE applications"
msgstr ""
"Si yá tienes un archivu de tema de fustaxes llocalmete, esti botón "
"desempaquetarálu y fadrá que tea disponible pa les aplicaciones de KDE."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QPushButton, btInstall)
#: emoticonslist.ui:85
#, fuzzy, kde-format
#| msgid "Install Theme File..."
msgid "Install from File"
msgstr "Instalar ficheru de tema..."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, cbStrict)
#: emoticonslist.ui:92
#, kde-format
msgid "Require spaces around emoticons"
msgstr "Riquir espaciu alredor de los fustaxes"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QPushButton, btRemoveTheme)
#: emoticonslist.ui:99
#, kde-format
msgid "Remove the selected theme from your disk"
msgstr "Desanicia'l tema esbilláu del to discu"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QPushButton, btRemoveTheme)
#: emoticonslist.ui:102
#, kde-format
msgid "This will remove the selected theme from your disk."
msgstr "Esto desaniciará del to discu'l tema esbilláu."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QPushButton, btRemoveTheme)
#: emoticonslist.ui:105
#, kde-format
msgid "Remove Theme"
msgstr "Desaniciar tema"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QPushButton, btNew)
#: emoticonslist.ui:125
#, kde-format
msgid "Design a new emoticon theme"
msgstr "Diseña un tema de fustaxes nuevu"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QPushButton, btNew)
#: emoticonslist.ui:128
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Start a new theme by assigning it a name. Then use the Add button on the "
"right to add emoticons to this theme."
msgstr ""
"Empecipia un tema nuevu asignándo-y un nome. Dempués usa'l botón Amestar a "
"la drecha p'amestar fustaxes a esti tema."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QPushButton, btNew)
#: emoticonslist.ui:131
#, fuzzy, kde-format
#| msgid "New Theme..."
msgid "New Theme"
msgstr "Tema nuevu..."

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QPushButton, btRemoveEmoticon)
#: emoticonslist.ui:138
#, kde-format
msgid "Remove the selected emoticon"
msgstr "Desanicia'l fustaxe esbilláu"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QPushButton, btRemoveEmoticon)
#: emoticonslist.ui:141
#, kde-format
msgid "Remove the selected emoticon from your disk"
msgstr "Desanicia'l fustaxe esbilláu del to discu"

